### 1. Cargar stock inicial de 50 unidades de "Ibuprofeno 400mg" (Dado que el inventario tiene 50 unidades)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/supplies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Ibuprofeno 400mg",
    "stock": 50
}

### 2. Enfermería administra 1 dosis de "Ibuprofeno 400mg" (Dispara el evento hacia Inventario y Facturación)
# Nota: Verifica en nursing-care.controller.ts la ruta exacta que puso el Integrante 2 (ej: /nursing-care/medication/administer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/nursing-care/medication/administer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "patientId": "paciente-ana-rojas",
    "nurseId": "enfermero-martin-torres",
    "medicationName": "Ibuprofeno 400mg",
    "dose": "400mg",
    "scheduledTime": "2026-10-21T14:00:00.000Z",
    "administeredTime": "2026-10-21T14:05:00.000Z"
}

### 3. Consultar el stock en Inventario 
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory/supplies/Ibuprofeno%20400mg
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}